{"ticker":"SJM","updated":"2026-11-20T23:18:43Z","profile":{"longName":"The J. M. Smucker Company","shortName":"The J.M. Smucker Company","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","country":"United States","website":"https://www.jmsmucker.com","fullTimeEmployees":null,"marketCap":14280122368,"trailingPE":62.46728,"forwardPE":12.154517,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.5594932,"pegRatio":2.17,"targetMeanPrice":142.375,"targetHighPrice":160.0,"targetLowPrice":120.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":16,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.05,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.37951002,"operatingMargins":0.18556,"profitMargins":0.02506,"totalRevenue":9156899840,"beta":0.252,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":136.3,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":88.25,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.41},"summary":"The J. M. Smucker Company manufactures and markets branded food and beverage products worldwide. The company operates through five segments: U.S. Retail Coffee, U.S. Retail Frozen Handheld and Spreads, U.S. Retail Pet Foods, Sweet Baked Snacks, and Away From Home. It offers coffee, sweet baked goods, pet snacks, frozen handheld products, peanut butter, cat and dog food, fruit and specialty spreads, cookies, frozen sandwiches and snacks, hot beverages, portion control products, toppings and syrups, baking mixes and ingredients, and flour. The company provides its products under the Folgers, Café Bustelo, Dunkin', Jif, Smucker's, Uncrustables, Meow Mix, Milk-Bone, Pup-Peroni, Canine Carry Outs, Hostess, and 1850 brand names. It sells its products through direct sales and brokers to food retailers, club stores, discount and dollar stores, online retailers, pet specialty stores, distributors, drug stores, military commissaries, mass merchandisers, supermarket chains, national mass retailers, convenience stores, vending channels, and foodservice distributors and operators. The J. M. Smucker Company was founded in 1897 and is headquartered in Orrville, Ohio.","summary_zh":"The J. M. Smucker Company manufactures and markets branded food and beverage products worldwide.該公司透過五個部門運作：美國零售咖啡部門、美國零售冷凍手持設備和塗抹醬部門、美國零售寵物食品部門、甜烘焙零食部門和戶外用品部門。它提供咖啡、甜烘焙食品、寵物零食、冷凍手持產品、花生醬、貓糧和狗糧、水果和特色醬料、餅乾、冷凍三明治和零食、熱飲料、份量控制產品、配料和糖漿、烘焙混合物和配料以及麵粉。該公司以 Folgers、Café Bustelo、Dunkin'、Jif、Smucker's、Uncrustables、Meow Mix、Milk-Bone、Pup-Peroni、Canine Carry Outs、Hostess 和 1850 品牌提供產品。該公司透過直接銷售和中間商的方式向食品零售商、俱樂部商店、折扣店和一元商店、線上零售商、寵物專賣店、分銷商、藥店、軍事小賣部、大賣場、連鎖超市、全國大型零售商、便利商店、自動販賣機以及食品服務經銷商和營運商銷售其產品。 The J. M. Smucker Company was founded in 1897 and is headquartered in Orrville, Ohio.","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"包裝食品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":109.0,"h":109.04,"l":107.4,"c":108.08,"v":2734400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":107.4,"h":108.81,"l":106.53,"c":108.01,"v":3808600},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":108.1,"h":110.91,"l":108.04,"c":110.32,"v":2592500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":110.95,"h":111.0,"l":107.57,"c":107.86,"v":1652800},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":108.33,"h":109.62,"l":108.17,"c":109.21,"v":1715600},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":109.13,"h":109.13,"l":106.7,"c":107.46,"v":1814800},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":107.49,"h":109.27,"l":107.14,"c":108.6,"v":1834200},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":108.77,"h":108.92,"l":106.81,"c":108.52,"v":1320500},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":107.94,"h":108.85,"l":107.22,"c":107.8,"v":1584500},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":108.0,"h":108.91,"l":107.74,"c":108.3,"v":1140800},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":107.95,"h":108.17,"l":106.77,"c":107.04,"v":1759400},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":107.28,"h":109.17,"l":106.15,"c":108.14,"v":1238300},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":107.59,"h":108.0,"l":105.14,"c":105.92,"v":849700},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":105.88,"h":105.99,"l":104.64,"c":105.12,"v":773300},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":105.68,"h":106.32,"l":104.55,"c":104.75,"v":1113500},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":104.2,"h":105.21,"l":100.69,"c":101.49,"v":1364600},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":101.61,"h":102.57,"l":100.76,"c":102.42,"v":1707800},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":101.87,"h":103.61,"l":101.68,"c":103.52,"v":1114500},{"t":"2025-10-16","o