ortfolio of trusted, iconic, market-leading brands that are sold to consumers primarily through retail outlets in North America.","zh":null},{"en":"We have five reportable segments: U.S. Retail Coffee, U.S. Retail Frozen Handheld and Spreads, and U.S. Retail Pet Foods (the \"U.S. Retail reportable segments\"), Sweet Baked Snacks, and Away From Home. During the fourth quarter of 2026, the Away From Home operating segment met the reportable segment criteria under Financial Accounting Standards Board (\"FASB\") Accounting Standards Codification (\"ASC\") 280. For additional information on our reportable segments, see Note 5: Reportable Segments.","zh":null},{"en":"On March 3, 2025, we sold certain Sweet Baked Snacks value brands to JTM Foods, LLC (\"JTM\"). The transaction included certain trademarks and licenses, a manufacturing facility in Chicago, Illinois, and approximately 400 employees who support the business. Under our ownership, these Sweet Baked Snacks value brands generated net sales of approximately $48.4 and $30.0 in 2025 and 2024, respectively, which were included in the Sweet Baked Snacks reportable segment.","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Customers: Sales to Walmart Inc. and subsidiaries, including Sam's Club, amounted to 34 percent of net sales in 2026 and 33 percent of net sales in both 2025 and 2024. These sales are primarily included in our U.S. Retail reportable segments. No other customer exceeded 10 percent of net sales for any year.","zh":null}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-04-30","items":[{"name":"U.S.Retail Coffee","val":3304900000,"zh":"U.S.Retail Coffee"},{"name":"U.S.Retail Frozen Handheld & Spreads","val":1853900000,"zh":"U.S.Retail Frozen Handheld & Spreads"},{"name":"U.S.Retail Pet Foods","val":1600000000,"zh":"U.S.Retail Pet Foods"},{"name":"Sweet Baked Snacks","val":971300000,"zh":"Sweet Baked Snacks"},{"name":"Away From Home","val":879000000,"zh":"Away From Home"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":441800000,"zh":"All Other Segments"}],"total":9050900000},"geo":{"end":"2026-04-30","items":[{"name":"US","val":8568200000.000001,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"International","val":482700000,"zh":"國際"},{"name":"CA","val":340800000,"zh":"加拿大"},{"name":"All Other International","val":141900000,"zh":"All Other International"}],"total":9050900000}},"peers":["MKC","HRL","CPB","CAG","GIS"]}}